5
00:00:16.798 --> 00:00:19.732
NARRATOR: Consider the expression 'x + 5'.

6
00:00:19.732 --> 00:00:25.428
NARRATOR: The lexer recognizes 'x' as an
identifier token, '+' as an operator token,

7
00:00:25.428 --> 00:00:27.869
