11
00:00:39.145 --> 00:00:39.936
constructs uniformly.

12
00:00:39.936 --> 00:00:45.131
NARRATOR: The lexer operates as a state
machine that scans characters sequentially,

13
00:00:45.131 --> 00:00:47.729
