28
00:01:42.003 --> 00:01:42.457
organization.

29
00:01:42.457 --> 00:01:48.928
NARRATOR: This step transforms a flat sequence
of tokens into a tree that preserves nesting

30
00:01:48.928 --> 00:01:49.791
and relationships.

31
00:01:49.791 --> 00:01:54.998
NARRATOR: By enforcing grammar rules, the
parser catches structural errors early,

32
00:01:54.998 --> 00:01:58.312
preventing malformed code from reaching
semantic analysis.

33
00:01:58.312 --> 00:02:02.993
NARRATOR: The parser's output becomes the
foundation for subsequent validation and low

34
00:02:03.122 --> 00:02:08.688
NARRATOR: The abstract syntax tree captures
the program's logical structure without

35
00:02:08.688 --> 00:02:12.230
retaining syntactic details like parentheses
